<title>NETHERLANDS: WOLTERS SEES 1997 EPS UP SOME 19.5 PCT.</title>
<headline>WOLTERS SEES 1997 EPS UP SOME 19.5 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch business publisher Wolters Kluwer NV said on Tuesday it expected full-year fully-diluted earnings per share of about 8.40 guilders in 1997, up about 19.5 percent from 1996's 7.03 guilders.</p>
<p>The company had previously forecast that annual growth in earnings per share would amount to at least 15 percent from 1997 to 1999.</p>
</text>
